WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.800
Create a local encrypted vault. The original document stays on your device.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.800
Anchor a salted document fingerprint as a self-recorded, unverified NFT.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.800
Issue a fictional training credential with real cryptographic signatures.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Review exactly which issuer-signed fields the requester can see.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:24.900
Approve a BBS selective-disclosure proof. Hidden name and score remain private.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.500
Lock the vault. The encrypted backup also restores it in a separate browser.

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:34.800
This passed run also checked replay, tampering and live revocation. See linked evidence.
